# The fm bass preset: a line with accents; the index decays with the host envelope towards the sustain level.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 1.0
track bass
preset 24 150 0 90 110 30 0 0 128 0 128 210 0 0 0 0 0 0
note 0 A1 2 100
note 2 A1 1 60
note 4 C2 2 127
note 6 A1 1 70
note 8 E2 2 100
note 10 G1 2 127
note 12 A1 3 50
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 22
expect peak_below 0
